Camp Afro Foli is a 3 day drum and dance camp for all skill levels in drum and dance. You can bring your friends and take workshops at your leisure, or you can train back to back workshops. There is something for everyone and the vibe is always beyond high. Get fit, meet new people and step out of daily life with something unique and exciting. This annual camp is a jam packed program all located 500 metres from the beach. The facilitators are beyond amazing and are sure to share their knowledge and their beautiful characters. Smile, laugh, share and rejuvenate at Camp Afro Foli from July 12th-14th.  
See [Camp Afro Foli in action](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NNmTMrm8y5s&feature=youtu.be) or check out some of these beautiful shots captured by Jimmy Halliday last year at Camp Afro Foli Winter Retreat. [Grab your early bird tickets now.](/product/camp-afro-foli-full-camp/)

